01:12:04.690 --> 01:12:05.800
If...

01:12:06.040 --> 01:12:11.160
If these mutations forced by the energy sources we're talking about have taken place,

01:12:11.850 --> 01:12:16.650
they must be individualized by means of a photosensitive gamma synthesizer.

01:12:18.180 --> 01:12:19.540
What the hell is that?

01:12:19.580 --> 01:12:21.300
A kind of photographic machine.

01:12:21.340 --> 01:12:24.700
If the cells have absorbed gamma radiations, they are measurable,

01:12:24.900 --> 01:12:27.540
adjusting special photosensitive plates.

01:12:27.740 --> 01:12:30.000
- Shall we try? - Yes, yes, okay.

01:12:31.630 --> 01:12:34.030
I heard a voice from heaven that said:

01:12:34.250 --> 01:12:38.430
"Blessed are those who die in the Lord from now on.

01:12:38.800 --> 01:12:40.630
Their spirit will rejoice

01:12:40.780 --> 01:12:44.580
and they will rest from their fatigue in the luminous vision of God.

01:12:45.080 --> 01:12:47.160
Now I will reveal a mystery.

01:12:47.620 --> 01:12:50.420
None of us will sleep forever,

01:12:50.440 --> 01:12:54.590
but at his command we will be transformed in an instant,

01:12:54.910 --> 01:12:57.080
because the trumpet will sound

01:12:57.210 --> 01:13:00.000
and the dead will resurface incorruptible

01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:02.000
clothed in his own flesh.

01:13:02.000 --> 01:13:05.720
Because all of us must appear visible

01:13:05.720 --> 01:13:08.720
to submit to the final judgment.

01:13:08.720 --> 01:13:11.860
And each one will see manifest on his body

01:13:11.860 --> 01:13:13.720
the things made in life,

01:13:13.720 --> 01:13:15.640
whether good or bad,

01:13:15.640 --> 01:13:17.750
because we know that the terrestrial house

01:13:17.750 --> 01:13:20.750
of our tabernacle will be dissolved.

01:13:20.750 --> 01:13:22.990
We have a celestial house,

01:13:22.990 --> 01:13:26.040
a house that is not built with our hands.

01:13:26.040 --> 01:13:28.020
It is eternal in the heavens,

01:13:28.020 --> 01:13:30.000
since our Lord Almighty

01:13:30.030 --> 01:13:41.880
We entrust his body to the earth, ashes to ashes, dust to dust, waiting for the final resurrection.

01:13:41.880 --> 01:13:54.480
May the grace of Jesus Christ, our Lord, the love of God and the infinite wisdom of the Holy Spirit accompany you and comfort you for centuries and centuries. Amen.

01:14:24.990 --> 01:14:25.630
They are.

01:14:44.520 --> 01:14:48.600
- Do you still like it? - I think so.

01:14:53.610 --> 01:14:55.540
I know I've made your life impossible.

01:15:00.220 --> 01:15:09.250
But I would like to rectify, to see if I can still excite you.

01:15:58.990 --> 01:15:59.510
I'm sorry.

01:16:00.030 --> 01:16:04.030
- You and the others? - What are you talking about? Are you crazy?

01:16:04.030 --> 01:16:06.030
They're here! They're here!

01:16:06.030 --> 01:16:07.880
No!

01:16:07.880 --> 01:16:15.840
No!

01:16:15.840 --> 01:16:25.700
Julie?

01:16:31.240 --> 01:16:42.260
And I know what he has discovered, and I would like to explain it to him, in the background it is very simple, I already have a certain idea of ​​it, and I think that a simple explanation will not be enough.

01:16:42.260 --> 01:16:58.640
Well, maybe not Julie, but come to my office, and I promise you that you will be more than satisfied when you see what it is about, it has nothing to do with me.

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:01.670
You're a woman too, aren't you?

01:17:30.030 --> 01:17:44.700
I wanted to see her alone, Juley.

01:17:44.700 --> 01:17:56.490
Stop, you can't go over.

01:17:56.490 --> 01:17:58.300
What do you mean? I have to go to Brando.

01:17:58.300 --> 01:18:00.000
There's a car at the end of the line.

01:18:00.030 --> 01:18:04.680
We're going to get out of here, get out of here.

01:18:04.680 --> 01:18:06.090
Somebody stop him.

01:18:06.090 --> 01:18:24.610
Hey, you ought to get out of here.

01:19:21.500 --> 01:19:23.590
I'll take this lever and it'll be the end of July.

01:19:36.840 --> 01:19:38.710
Don't move, you bastard!

01:21:31.530 --> 01:21:33.530
But I don't understand why so many deaths.

01:21:33.770 --> 01:21:35.770
Well, what Susan Harris ignored

01:21:36.180 --> 01:21:38.910
was that the radiation had made them sterile.

01:21:39.150 --> 01:21:43.190
Therefore, they were forced to copulate with unlimited anxiety.

01:21:45.580 --> 01:21:46.780
Oh, my God.

01:21:47.210 --> 01:21:48.460
Write it all down, huh?

01:21:49.180 --> 01:21:50.320
Do you still need it?

01:21:51.210 --> 01:21:53.890
No, no, no, no. Go to rest the two of you.

01:21:54.010 --> 01:21:55.330
I'll take care of the rest.

01:21:55.370 --> 01:21:56.810
Come, I'll take you home.

01:21:57.360 --> 01:22:00.000
Agar, I sincerely hope

01:22:00.000 --> 01:22:02.820
to see him around here, as a tourist.

01:22:08.440 --> 01:22:11.940
It's a terrible tragedy, because everything can happen so suddenly.

01:22:11.940 --> 01:22:16.880
Well, Susan Harris is a good example, she surpasses any possible imagination.

01:22:16.880 --> 01:22:20.980
It gets to the point where the mind adapts to this absurd plasticized paradise.

01:22:20.980 --> 01:22:25.440
We could not even exist, it's as if we were wandering souls under hypnosis.

01:22:25.440 --> 01:22:30.000
The brain is reduced to a computer. Sometimes I wake up suddenly and I feel

01:22:30.000 --> 01:22:36.100
It's like when in a dream you see yourself doing the most absurd things.

01:22:36.100 --> 01:22:41.160
If we stop to think a little on the subject, the scabrous points of the situation are evident.

01:22:41.160 --> 01:22:45.610
In reality it is not too difficult, just have some reasoning.

01:22:45.610 --> 01:22:51.430
The bad thing is when the cells begin to suffer certain malformations, then everything is possible.

01:22:51.430 --> 01:22:55.010
I would like to write a book on this subject, I'm sure it would be a great success.

01:22:55.010 --> 01:22:57.670
The public accepts this type of arguments.

01:22:57.670 --> 01:22:58.670
Don't you think?

01:22:58.670 --> 01:23:00.000
Think of my experience.

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:02.000
Think about it, isn't it a perfect example?

01:23:02.000 --> 01:23:04.000
I won't do anything again without being sure.

01:23:04.000 --> 01:23:09.000
Without a precise qualification at a practical level that understands Kung Fu, Karate and Judo...

01:23:09.000 --> 01:23:14.000
...today you can't face certain situations like taking someone and throwing him in the air.

01:23:14.000 --> 01:23:14.920
Like this, huh?

01:23:17.650 --> 01:23:20.650
There's no right! There's no right! You're overreacting!

01:23:27.880 --> 01:23:30.000
-What were you saying? -Shut up.

01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:31.800
I don't know.
